===============================
Prompt 
===============================

Create a Timer miniApp. And place at in layout page 2.

When starting the timer the interval is entered, in minutes and seconds; 
with seconds being optional.

The timer is expired when the start time plus interval exceeds the current 
wall time.  When the timer has expired, play alarm, audio morse code H,
repeatedly.

When the Timer miniApp is being terminated and the timer has not expired, 
save the timer state and expiration time using params. When the Timer miniApp 
is restarted, read the params, and if the timer state is running then either 
continue the countdown or play the audio morse H alarm, based on the 
expiration wall time.

When the Timer miniApp app is being terminated and the timer has expired, 
then cancel the alarm and set params to indicate the timer is not running.

While the alarm is playing, continue to display the timer countdown value,
using negative number.

The resolution of the timer shall be minutes:seconds.
  
Controls to start, pause, and cancel the timer shall be provided.

